---
import StorefrontLayout from '../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout
  title="Our Thesis"
  description="How Symeno leverages volume to collapse retail margins."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-[#0b1516]">
    <section
      class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-[#dae5e6]/5 py-24 md:py-32"
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 h-[500px] w-[500px] rounded-full bg-[#36f4a4] opacity-[0.03] blur-[100px]"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <span
          class="mb-6 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-[#36f4a4] uppercase"
          >The Symeno Thesis</span
        >
        <h1
          class="mb-8 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tighter text-white md:text-6xl"
        >
          Retail margins are a tax on the uninformed. <span
            class="text-[#dae5e6]/40">We refuse to pay it.</span
          >
        </h1>
        <div
          class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light text-[#dae5e6]/70"
        >
          <p>
            Symeno LLC was not founded by traditional retailers. We are data
            analysts and supply chain specialists who recognized a massive
            inefficiency in global commerce: the layers of middlemen inflating
            the cost of premium hardware.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every time a product moves from a manufacturer to a distributor, to
            a regional wholesaler, and finally to a retail storefront, a margin
            is added. You end up paying for their marketing budgets, their real
            estate, and their bloated operations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
            <h2 class="mb-12 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
              How the math works.
            </h2>

            <div class="relative space-y-12 border-l border-[#dae5e6]/10 pl-8">
              <div class="relative">
                <span
                  class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#36f4a4] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(54,244,164,0.5)]"
                ></span>
                <span
                  class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white"
                  >01</span
                >
                <h3
                  class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase"
                >
                  Volume Aggregation
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-[#dae5e6]/60">
                  We pool capital to execute massive wholesale orders directly
                  with authorized distributors. Buying in volume grants us
                  pricing tiers inaccessible to standard retailers.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <span
                  class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full border border-[#dae5e6]/30 bg-[#131d1e]"
                ></span>
                <span
                  class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white"
                  >02</span
                >
                <h3
                  class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase"
                >
                  Minimal Overhead
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-[#dae5e6]/60">
                  No physical storefronts. No massive ad campaigns. Our
                  operations are lean, entirely cloud-based, and highly
                  automated. We don't need a 40% margin to survive.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <span
                  class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full border border-[#dae5e6]/30 bg-[#131d1e]"
                ></span>
                <span
                  class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white"
                  >03</span
                >
                <h3
                  class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase"
                >
                  Margin Compression
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-[#dae5e6]/60">
                  We take a flat, sustainable fractional margin on wholesale
                  cost. The entire remaining delta between our cost and the RRP
                  stays in your bank account.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex flex-col justify-center border border-[#dae5e6]/10 bg-[#131d1e] p-8 shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] md:p-12"
          >
            <h3 class="mb-8 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
              Corporate Integrity
            </h3>

            <ul class="space-y-6 font-mono text-sm">
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-[#dae5e6]/5 pb-4">
                <span class="text-[#dae5e6]/50 uppercase">Legal Entity</span>
                <span class="text-right text-white">Symeno LLC</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-[#dae5e6]/5 pb-4">
                <span class="text-[#dae5e6]/50 uppercase">Inventory Status</span
                >
                <span class="text-right text-[#36f4a4]"
                  >100% Owned & Stocked<br /><span
                    class="text-[10px] text-[#dae5e6]/40"
                    >(No Dropshipping)</span
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-[#dae5e6]/5 pb-4">
                <span class="text-[#dae5e6]/50 uppercase"
                  >Payment Processing</span
                >
                <span class="text-right text-white"
                  >Stripe (PCI DSS Level 1)</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between pb-2">
                <span class="text-[#dae5e6]/50 uppercase"
                  >Customer Guarantee</span
                >
                <span class="text-right text-white"
                  >30-Day Returns<br />Authenticity Verified</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="mt-12 border-t border-[#dae5e6]/10 pt-8">
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#dae5e6]/50 italic">
                "Trust is earned through transparency and execution. We don't
                ask you to trust our marketing; we ask you to verify our
                prices."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
